one-question: credits and licences

Picture: original code (three.js, MIT licence, https://threejs.org) rendered frame by frame in headless Chromium on this machine. No stock footage, no generated video, no paid services, no logos.
Map data: Natural Earth (public domain, https://www.naturalearthdata.com): ne_110m_land (land polygons, no borders) and ne_50m_populated_places_simple (city lights), via github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector.
Brick numbers: o200k_base vocabulary (GPT-4o tokenizer) via the Hugging Face port Xenova/gpt-4o (tokenizer.json), used only to compute the seven numbers shown on screen.
Emoji (pizza, egg): Noto Color Emoji (Google, SIL Open Font License 1.1), system font.

