  Barlow Condensed (Jeremy Tribby), https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/barlowcondensed

Voice: Fish Audio text-to-speech (https://fish.audio), model s2-pro, public library voice "Explainer" (id 3e8a237e7b5d4eaab50bd9e05053d70e), generated through the Fish Audio API on the client's own paid account; the script is in fish_vo.json.
Earlier scratch voice (still built by ./build.sh with no options): Kokoro-82M via kokoro-onnx, voice am_puck (Apache-2.0, https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M).
